{"id":"455758","name":"牛奶滑蛋","author":"朋小姐姐","authorId":"11363265","desc":"","cover":"images/455758/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛奶","amount":"106g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"葡萄干","amount":"13g"}],"sub":[{"name":"糖","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"全部材料直接倒入一个碗中。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/20190511155754207949811363265.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"搅拌均匀就好了，要想吃细腻一点的可以先把牛奶鸡蛋混匀之后过筛，再加葡萄干，我这就省了。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/20190511155754222842111363265.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入锅蒸十分钟左右。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/20190511155754224482611363265.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"不好看不重要，好吃最好。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/20190511155754229456011363265.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"小宝宝最适合了。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/20190511155754232955011363265.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"欣赏～","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/11/20190511155754234630411363265.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"牛奶和鸡蛋的比例最好是1：1或者1.5：1，我这里一个鸡蛋可食部分大约53g，中等大小。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}